FreeBSD's qcom_rmtfs (freebsd/dsp): the region's address and size as sysctls (hw.qcom_rmtfs.*) instead of udev's sysfs attributes; the GPT partitions by GEOM's labels (/dev/gpt) instead of /dev/disk/by-partlabel. sig_int_count declared once (sig_atomic_t is long on FreeBSD/arm64, not int).

diff --git a/rmtfs.c b/rmtfs.c
